  "confirmation_source": "Owner approval in session 2026-10-07: denoised-only release; reviewed W32 (D050/Q14) display carried over only for features whose W39 distribution is comparable (IQR ratio 0.8-1.25 and median shift <0.25 IQR vs W32); neutral linear/full for new features and for features whose scale or population changed (depolarisation_slope, recovery_slope, repolarisation_slope, tip_val: ~1e5 scale change; spike_count: population shift; channel_labels: categorical). CSD features were checked across W37/W38/W39 and did not change scale; they use neutral linear/full. Six W32 features absent from W39 (peak_time_secs, peak_val, recovery_time_secs, tip_time_secs, trough_time_secs, trough_val) are not published.",
